h('TGNH – Thế Giới Nước Hoa','services','Official /facial-service action returns a20-line Home shell without a service description; direct find has no service match. A URL label alone does not establish a usable service, eligibility or this branch’s facilities.',['search-18.json','open-15.json','follow-02.json'],['https://www.thegioinuochoa.com.vn/facial-service'],'Obtain a readable current official service description/action or explicit branch service statement; no facial treatment is inferred.')
h('The New Playground','website phone hours catalog services','Current mall index/search identifies the collective, but the alternate short official detail action redirects to the generic Vincom home, while the previous exact branch URL had a retained access failure. No independent official product/branch authority/action was established by exact brand searches. A descriptive mall article is not a catalogue or services action.',['search-18.json','service-search-17.json','final-research-01.json','final-research-02.json'],['https://vincom.com.vn/store/the-new-playground','https://vincom.com.vn/store/the-new-playground-vincom-center-dong-khoi'],'Retrieve a functioning official branch detail or authority-linked current brand channel; preserve collective identity and do not transfer unrelated local-brand contacts.')
n('Tommy Hilfiger','hours','Official distributor branch article and all-brand locator publish branch address/phone without opening hours. Exact official branch-hour search returns these same sources and generic contact material, with no further branch-hours action.',['locator-detail-02.json','details-03.json','contact-search-16.json'],['https://www.acfc.com.vn/blog/he-thong-cua-hang-tommy-hilfiger.html','https://www.acfc.com.vn/maplist'])
h('Tuyết Kiều','website phone hours catalog services','Official short mall detail action redirects to generic Vincom home; prior long branch URL failed. Broad searches expose unverified social/marketplace entities, not an authority-bound current jewellery catalogue/branch contact. Similar names are not sufficient to assign values.',['search-19.json','target-11.json','open-05.json','service-search-18.json','contact-search-16.json'],['https://vincom.com.vn/store/vang-tuyet-kieu','https://vincom.com.vn/store/vang-tuyet-kieu-vincom-center-dong-khoi'],'Obtain a usable official mall action or a mall/brand-authority-linked current Tuyết Kiều channel. Do not substitute unrelated fashion/jewellery sellers.')
h('Valentino Creations','phone hours catalog services','Inherited Vietnam brand domain and alternate store-list path are inaccessible. Broad official-name search returns the different Maison Valentino brand; no ownership/identity equivalence is established. Mall descriptive copy supplies no practical branch fields or actual catalogue/service action.',['search-19.json','target-07.json','final-research-01.json','final-research-02.json'],['https://vcfashion.vn/','https://vcfashion.vn/pages/he-thong-cua-hang'],'Retrieve a current official Valentino Creations product/locator source; never substitute Valentino Garavani/Maison Valentino.')
h('Viin Riic Niche Perfume','phone','Official branch row lists address/hours without a branch phone; contact/footer numbers are general brand support and are not expressly assigned to Đồng Khởi.',['locator-detail-02.json','open-17.json','contact-search-17.json'],['https://viinriic.com/en/store-locator/','https://viinriic.com/en/contact/'],'Obtain explicit phone-to-ĐồngKhởi association; do not label the general hotline as branch-direct.')
h('Viin Riic Niche Perfume','services','The official locator’s Private Booking action is explicitly attached to Gallery112LýChínhThắng, not Vincom45ALýTựTrọng. The same brand identity does not establish this branch’s booking/service applicability.',['locator-detail-02.json','service-search-18.json','contact-search-17.json'],['https://viinriic.com/en/store-locator/'],'Obtain an official Vincom-specific service/booking statement or a clearly general brand-wide service independent of the other branch.')
h('Winmart','phone hours catalog services','Official current product category extracts a seven-line shell without readable products; branch-hour/contact searches expose historical catalogue news and general support, not a directly readable current Đồng Khởi branch result. No general support line, online schedule or past promotional catalogue is assigned as current branch information.',['search-20.json','target-08.json','contact-search-17.json','final-research-01.json'],['https://winmart.vn/duong--c01151','https://winmart.vn/info/customer-support','https://winmart.vn/'],'Read functioning official product and Đồng Khởi store/service results; keep the dynamic extraction gap and historic publication dates explicit.')
h('ZARA','phone hours','Official Vincom branch locator exposes address/categories and a MoreInfo control, but no contact/hour content in the extraction. Current-closed status is transient, not a schedule or closure claim; corporate contact is not substituted.',['open-09.json','locator-detail-02.json','contact-search-17.json'],['https://www.zara.com/vn/vi/stores-locator/zara-ho-chi-minh-vincom-center-s11733'],'Read the actual official branch MoreInfo hour/contact panel through a functioning retrieval surface.')

