# Exact unresolved service source for the remaining eyecare key is handled by
# a direct first-party service follow-up, rather than a “no services” default.
add('Mắt Việt','services','https://matviet.vn/pages/about-us','matviet-service.json','Actual official About page lines 121, 130 and 144–146 explicitly describe eye measurement, frame/lens selection advice and glasses fitting; lines 182–184 distinguish this from specialist diagnosis/treatment. Brand-wide information only; no fee, booking, clinical outcome or Dong Khoi availability promise.','brand-wide','Đo mắt, tư vấn chọn gọng và tròng kính, hỗ trợ lắp kính theo thông tin chung của Mắt Việt. Xác nhận dịch vụ với chi nhánh; đo mắt tại cửa hàng không thay thế chẩn đoán hoặc điều trị chuyên khoa.','Eye measurement, frame and lens selection advice, and glasses fitting are described by Mắt Việt. Confirm service availability with the branch; in-store measurement does not replace specialist diagnosis or treatment.')
